# Adversarial firmware: contradiction hunting, negative-evidence weighting, and conservative standing proof.
k 3
lambda 0.03
hops 10
top always
order standing

role by UPOS
role 1 NOUN ADJ NUM
role 0.75 PROPN
role 0.5 VERB ADV ADP PART
role 0.25 PRON DET CCONJ PUNCT
role 0.15 SCONJ
role 0.10 AUX

for hop
  fan 4096

for search
  fan 512

for pull
  fan 4096
  lexicalization wn-lmf Sense language ili
  up @wn-lmf/Sense
  usages wordnet-cntlist tag_cnt
  rounds 3
  breadth 64
  nearest 512
  walks 64
  walkfan 512
  steps 4
  restart 0.2
  sure 3
  lift 2.5
  elect confidence agree grounds heads continuity shape cooccur walks shared
  tie ask
  seed observation
  ooda 2
  salience 0.20
  multitier on
  combine on
  refuse predicate BNC PENN GF PT NER WSL Target Other Sent Verb Noun Adj Prep Adv UPOS XPOS DEPREL FEATS MISC LEMMA type n f itype "identifier vocabulary"
  negate not no never without neither nor fail false error
  negate_relation antonym excludes contradicts fails invalid
  scope_stop . ; : ? ! ,
  emit 48
  enough 0.25
  take fact
  take segment
  take attestations 4
  take constituents 2
  take chain 1 @wn-lmf/Sense @wn-lmf/synset @wn-lmf/Definition | @conllu/LEMMA @wn-lmf/Sense @wn-lmf/synset @wn-lmf/Definition
